  m_text: "The treatment was finally reduced to:\n\n\u25CF 2 hemodialysis sessions
    per week, of 5 hours each.\n\u25CF A medical treatment.\n\u25CF LASIX\xAE 2 x
    40mg PO per day.\n\u25CF RENITEN\xAE 1 x 20mg PO per day\n\u25CF A diet with
    fluid restrictions to 1 liter per day.\n"
