  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "   \n\nSmoker since the age of 14.  \n\nLeft ventricular failure, and
    hypertension since 1999.\n\nChronic renal failure \n(secondary to chronic glomerulonephritis
    and nephroangiosclerosis) diagnosed in 2012, with partially preserved diuresis
    until June 2016.\n\nMrs. \xC2ngela Lopes has been known to the nephrology department
    since September 12, 2014.\r\nDuring this first hospitalization, she started hemodialysis
    (HD), and a Cimino-Brescia\r\narteriovenous fistula (AVF) was created in her
    left forearm"
