  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '   The discharge treatment prescribed by the nephrologist was 3 sessions
    of 4 hours of HD per week, at the hospital''s dialysis center.


    The patient
    and her husband refused to submit to such

    restrictions.

'
